# trigger. Turn 3: the Mountain is no longer playable (CR 611.2a, "until end of turn" has ended), and the second turn's Lightning Bolt
# triggers it again (and Elusive Otter's prowess), which Bot1 declines, so the next Mountain stays in the library (still only one card in exile).

